(7678721, 1255584, 30049, '<td valign="top">Dang!  Had this picked for 2nd place overall (I was your 8 - my top pick was the eventual Blue).  I love the story that''s being told here.  Perfect balance and handling of the various pieces (tube, tubers, river, even the sky cooperated!).  Only minor nit is this might have a slight lean to the left.  Hard to tell as both edges appear to have some perspective distortion (trees leaning outward).  The river bank alignment may also be contributing to the leftward impression (it''s tough when the waterline doesn''t line up with a horizon exactly - but I''m preaching to the choir.  :-} ).</td>', 'Dang!  Had this picked for 2nd place overall (I was your 8 - my top pick was the eventual Blue).  I love the story that''s being told here.  Perfect balance and handling of the various pieces (tube, tubers, river, even the sky cooperated!).  Only minor nit is this might have a slight lean to the left.  Hard to tell as both edges appear to have some perspective distortion (trees leaning outward).  The river bank alignment may also be contributing to the leftward impression (it''s tough when the waterline doesn''t line up with a horizon exactly - but I''m preaching to the choir.  :-} ).', '2020-11-04 05:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
